   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>アナハイムのルセットさん、\n<im(1)>それに、カトル君たちの協力で\n#c[5E8FD8]ガンダム３号機#cを手に入れることができた。",
   "en": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>Thanks to Ms. Lucette of Anaheim\n<im(1)>and the help of Quatre and his team,\nwe acquired #c[5E8FD8]Gundam Unit 3#c.",
   "notes": "Sinapus acknowledging Lucette Audevie and Quatre."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63174#1",
   "layer": "debriefing",
