   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>以後、<im(2)>#c[5E8FD8]プリベンター#c所属の#c[5E8FD8]ガンダムチーム#cと\nノイン特尉は本艦に配属となる。",
   "en": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>From now on, <im(2)>the #c[5E8FD8]Preventer#c #c[5E8FD8]Gundam team#c\nand Special Lieutenant Noin are assigned to\nour ship.",
   "notes": "Preventer Gundam team assigned to the Albion."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63174#2",
   "layer": "debriefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 37,
