    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>さて、#c[BE5050]コロニー#cについてだが……\nノイン特尉の話によると、我々はまたしても\n#c[BE5050]デラーズ#cにしてやられたようだ。",
   "en": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>Now, concerning the #c[BE5050]colony#c...\nAccording to Special Lieutenant Noin,\nwe were outwitted by #c[BE5050]Delaz#c yet again.",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63174#3",
   "layer": "debriefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 37,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(37,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "<im(4)>",
    "#c[BE5050]",
    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)><im(4)>#c[BE5050]コロニー#cは月面には落下せず、\n月の周回軌道で推進剤を点火して、\nそのまま月の軌道を離脱した。",
   "en": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)><im(4)>The #c[BE5050]colony#c did not fall to the Moon.\nIt fired thrusters in lunar orbit and\nbroke free of lunar orbit entirely.",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63174#4",
   "layer": "debriefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 37,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(37,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "<im(5)>",
    "#c[BE5050]",
    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)><im(5)>現在#c[BE5050]コロニー#cは、より大きな質量を持つ\n地球の重力に引かれ、自由落下コースへと\n乗りつつある。",
   "en": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)><im(5)>Currently, the #c[BE5050]colony#c is being drawn\nby the greater mass of Earth's gravity,\nentering a free-fall trajectory.",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63174#5",
   "layer": "debriefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 37,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(37,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "<im(6)>",
    "#c[BE5050]",
    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)><im(6)>星の屑作戦の真の狙いは、月でもなく、\n地球への#c[BE5050]コロニー#c落としだったと\nいうわけだ。",
   "en": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)><im(6)>The true objective of Operation Stardust\nwas never the Moon, but a #c[BE5050]colony#c drop\naimed directly at Earth.",
   "notes": "Operation Stardust true objective."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63174#6",
   "layer": "debriefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 37,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(37,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "#c[BE5050]",
    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>#c[BE5050]コロニー#cは、あと９時間で阻止限界点に\n到達する。ここを突破されれば、\n地球への落下は阻止できん。",
   "en": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>The #c[BE5050]colony#c reaches the interception limit\nin nine hours. If it breaks through there,\nits fall to Earth cannot be stopped.",
   "notes": "Interception limit."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63174#7",
   "layer": "debriefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 37,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(37,1)>",
