   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>これより#c[5E8FD8]アルビオン#cは、<im(7)>最大戦速で\n#c[BE5050]コロニー#cを追う。",
   "en": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>From here on, the #c[5E8FD8]Albion#c will pursue<im(7)>\nthe #c[BE5050]colony#c at maximum combat speed.",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63174#8",
   "layer": "debriefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 37,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(37,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>だが、先ほども話したように、ガンダムの\n強奪事件、核攻撃の責任を問われ、\nコーウェン准将はすでに解任された。",
   "en": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>However, as I mentioned, Commodore Cowen\nwas dismissed, held responsible for the\nGundam theft and nuclear attack.",
   "notes": "Commodore Cowen."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63174#9",
   "layer": "debriefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 37,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(37,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>我々はすでに今回の任を解かれた状態\nなのだ。",
   "en": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>We have already effectively been relieved\nof our duties for this mission.",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63174#10",
   "layer": "debriefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 37,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(37,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>これから先の作戦行動は命令違反と\n見なされるかもしれん。",
   "en": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>Any operational action from this point on\nmay be deemed insubordination.",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63174#11",
   "layer": "debriefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 37,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(37,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>軍の命令に背くことはできないと\n考える者がいれば、\n今この場で申し出てくれ。",
   "en": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>If there is anyone who feels they cannot\ndefy military orders, step forward\nhere and now.",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63174#12",
   "layer": "debriefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 37,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(37,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>……………………\n誰も……いないのかね？",
   "en": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>...............\nIs there... no one?",
   "notes": "Sinapus asking if anyone objects."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63174#13",
   "layer": "debriefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 46,
   "tokens": [
