   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(46,1)><sp(2)>艦長。今は#c[BE5050]コロニー#cを止めるのが先決です。\nそれに異を唱える者はいません。\n急ぎましょう。",
   "en": "<op(46,1)><sp(2)>Captain. Halting the #c[BE5050]colony#c comes first.\nNone among us would object to that.\nLet us hurry.",
   "notes": "Amuro Ray replying on behalf of all pilots."
  },
